  "title": "Docker sandbox provider for osf",
  "summary": "Adds a provider-neutral sandbox seam to the osf crate and a Docker adapter behind it, plus an `osf sandbox run` subcommand that creates a throwaway container, runs one command inside it, and always removes it. Validation of the image, user, mounts and command happens before any docker call; a signal watcher removes the sandbox on SIGINT/SIGTERM.",
